  "details": "In the new beta version, 1452, the friends list in the wing panel has incorrect padding between entries when sorting is set to by location and you scroll down to players in the \"Online in Private Worlds\" section. See the attached pictures for an example.\n\n1. Open the quick menu or main menu.\n\n2. Open the left or right wing panel.\n\n3. Select the Friends panel mode.\n\n4. Change SORT BY to Location.\n\n5. Scroll down the list to see friends that are online but in private.\n\nIt can also be seen on locations that have multiple friends to a lesser degree.",
